 17 pages, same numbers and flow as the Phone page · 2026-11-20)&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#241C10;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="3000" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c602" value="&amp;lt;b&amp;gt;One website, two layouts.&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt; The same pages and login work in a laptop browser and on a phone (installable as an app). Below about 700 px wide, the Phone layout is used.&lt;br&gt;&amp;lt;b&amp;gt;Changes on a laptop:&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt; a left sidebar replaces the bottom menu · two-column layouts · keyboard shortcuts (Space = talk, 1–4 = answer, Enter = check) · lessons and games hide the sidebar (focus mode)." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;rounded=1;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#E3A008;fontColor=#4A4030;align=left;spacing=10;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="110" width="2000" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c603" value="&amp;lt;b style='font-size:16px'&amp;gt;Laptop-only notes&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• The mic needs HTTPS. The browser asks for permission once per site.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Chrome, Edge and Safari all support the mic + Azure Speech in the browser.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Laptop sizes drawn at 880 px wide. Real layouts stretch up to about 1200 px, then stay centered.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Keyboard shortcuts are extras. Everything also works with a mouse." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;rounded=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A13D3D;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#241C10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2720" width="880" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>